      "author": "ggajos",
      "description": "Tasks Eye 8.0.0 is the clean public release prepared for the Obsidian Community Plugins directory.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Obsidian 1.12.7 or newer\n- The Tasks community plugin installed and enabled\n\n## What changed\n\n- Tasks Eye no longer assigns default hotkeys, so it will not override existing shortcuts. Assign the optional recommendations yourself in **Settings → Hotkeys**.\n- All commands and recommended shortcuts now live in one reference: https://ggajos.github.io/ggajos-tasks-eye/reference/commands/\n- Installation, settings, and availability documentation were refreshed for the community release. Optional public-holiday availability uses the Nager.Date service.\n\nThe attached `main.js`, `manifest.json`, and `styles.css` files are the installable Obsidian release assets.",
